WEBVTT

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.440
Hell and Heaven!

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.370
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.340
He's gone beyond his physical limits!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:33.630
Just one more Hell and Heaven attack, and Gai's life will be...

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.560
Professor, when will work on this G-Tool be completed?

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:45.140
We already have it in working order.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:48.440
But in the condition GaoGaiGar's in now...

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:51.820
...there's no way he could control the G-Tool's power.

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:53.740
And if he were to use it?

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.320
If he did...

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.280
...then GaoGaiGar's body would be smashed to pieces.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.620
The one thing I won't sacrifice is Gai's life!

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:11.160
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:14.060
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:20.970
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:25.060
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.780
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.060
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:40.980
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:44.900
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:47.700
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:51.460
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:56.460
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.630
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:02.170
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:05.300
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.260
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:12.340
Dividing Driver!

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:19.980
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:25.860
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.810
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:32.700
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.710
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.720
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:40.130
A Promise Made Beyond the Light

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.510
<i>A Promise Made Beyond the Light</i>

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.820
Let's begin monitoring his foreign-body reactions.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.730
Start monitoring process...

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.830
How's Gai doing?

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.370
We've just finished swapping out his parts, so all we have to do now is...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.380
...let him sleep until the neutralization process is over.

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:17.510
I do appreciate your concern for Gai, Mikoto, but I wish you'd get some rest.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.170
He's absolutely right!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:21.220
You need to go home once in a while...

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:25.180
...or you'll end up like Operator Entohji, a total mess!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.230
Well, then...

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.900
I'll see you tomorrow, then.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.270
Right.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.360
Good night, Gai.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:52.420
From the GGG Bay Tower Base Station under the sea, one can directly...

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:57.460
...access the Space Development Corporation ground level by elevator.

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:01.840
Members of the secret GGG organization have an official cover...

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:05.850
...that they are employees of the Space Development Corporation.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.180
But this is a secret that they must keep at all costs...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.230
...even from their SDC "colleagues".

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.990
Hey, you!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.120
Hold on...

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.620
Is that you, Mr. Ando? From Administration?

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.830
What's going on? Why are you dressed like that?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:55.140
Orbital calculations are just a piece of cake for me!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:00.110
That's the world's most advanced astronomical telescope.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.610
Your father's job is to make sure the space shuttles land safely.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.820
Awesome! Waha!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.490
Waha!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.500
Are you sure this is going to help you?

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:16.370
Yeah, it's great!

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:19.500
Hey, Amami, could you get those files checked for me right away?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.550
Yes, sir! I'm on it!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.300
Okay, then, I'm going now.

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.590
Okay. Be careful getting home.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.510
Sure!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.640
Is that you, Mamoru?

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:36.190
Chief Taiga!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.520
What brings you here today?

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.110
It's for school, Chief.

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.400
I have to write an essay called "My Dad at Work."

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:44.070
I came here to do some research!

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:47.150
"My Dad at Work", eh?

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.450
In that case, let me show you something that may help you!

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.330
For real?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.540
Excuse me.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.500
So what are you going to show me?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.710
Well, just take a look at this.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:54.560
This is Island Two, our Orbit Base scheduled for completion in 2017.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:59.560
Once it's up and running, we'll see a new era of space exploration.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.520
Waha! That's so awesome!

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:07.030
Mamoru, I think you should know... your father is building this station.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:07.490
Huh?

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:11.700
Of course, he's not building it all by himself.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:14.410
We could never realize a project on the scale of Island Two...

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.990
...without the combined efforts of a good number of people.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:22.040
And your father is an indispensable member of this task force.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.130
What do you think?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.420
Will this help you write your essay?

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:28.090
Yes, sir!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:30.760
What?

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.060
Now switching to emergency backup power.

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:49.150
The Space Development Corporation is currently experiencing a...

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.780
...power outage throughout the building.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.490
We are now looking into the cause for the outage.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:57.580
We ask all employees to continue their operations on backup power...

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:27.110
What in tarnation are those clowns doing up there?

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:31.360
Apparently the whole SDC tower's being trashed...

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.740
And they don't think it's being caused by intruders...

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:37.320
I can't find any signs of the computer system being hacked!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.370
Call an emergency meeting right away!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:39.740
Right.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.710
Hello? I'm calling from the conference room on the 27th floor!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.040
Hello? Hello!

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:46.710
Unbelievable...

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.210
How can there be no answer from any of the SDC sections?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.710
Chief Taiga...

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.260
There's something strange going on.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.340
I can sense Zonders nearby...

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.510
...and there's a lot of them...

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.850
Do you mean we're under attack by a horde of Zonders?

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.350
I'm not really sure...

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:06.350
The situation is a lot more grim than I thought...

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:09.360
Mamoru, you and I must hurry to the Main Order Room!

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:10.690
Yes, sir!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:19.700
What the...

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.410
Sakura!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.250
What on earth are you doing?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:42.600
Mamoru, you've got to hang onto me no matter what!

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:43.470
Yes, sir.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.270
Let's go!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.400
Chief Taiga!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.110
Forgive me.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:04.910
What the...

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.550
Titanium Head Driver!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:31.150
Farewell, all!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.820
Wow, that was amazing, Chief!

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.240
Ouch...

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.450
Are you okay?

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:48.370
Yes. It's just that I hadn't exercised in so long, I think I tweaked my back.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.420
Is that all?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:54.750
Mamoru!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.560
Dad!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.490
Koji Andoh, aged 26, currently working in the...

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.200
...Administration Department at the Space Development Center...

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.240
Just the day before, this ordinary young man fell into the nefarious...

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.870
...clutches of the Zonderians...

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.290
What kind of magic trick is that?

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.670
Is sleight-of-hand a hobby of yours?

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.880
Then perhaps you'll indulge me by performing the ultimate magic trick?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:43.430
What do you mean?

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.760
Now then, take this...

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:58.980
Zonder!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.490
Waha!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.450
Amami, that's enough!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:03.950
Dad, stop it, please!

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.450
Waha!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.210
Dad!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.790
Don't worry, he's just unconscious.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.590
It's really faint, but I can sense a Zonder in my dad, too.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.340
But it's a little different from all the other times!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.300
We'd better have the Professor examine him right away.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:30.600
Is that you, Mikoto?

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.480
Mikoto!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:41.530
Z-Sensor scanning shows traces of Elementary Particle Z0 have been...

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:44.950
...detected across 43% of the Space Development Corporation tower!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:50.240
Chief, we've run tests on Mr. Amami, and found something unbelievable.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:51.830
Unbelievable, did you say?

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.760
This thing here, at 100,000x magnification.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:05.260
100,000 times?

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:09.720
Yes. I found a parasitic micromachine inside his central nervous system.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.220
Apparently the Zonder host is sending...

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.020
...a terahertz-frequency ultra-short wave signal to these micromachines.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.860
This is what's causing everyone's abnormal behavior.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.360
Can you believe that?

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:22.690
So the Zonder's been spreading micromachines all over the SDC?

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.650
What a terrible thing to do!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.410
Still, why were Mamoru and I able to escape...

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.530
...being infected by these micromachines?

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.410
It's quite simple, really.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.460
As GGG members, we've all got these pagers...

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:40.000
...which also transmit ultra-short wave signals, to track each other's location.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.090
It's the interference from our pagers...

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.670
...that's been invalidating the signals from the Zonder host.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.550
It was this pager that protected the Chief and me, huh?

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.930
Then if we were to send out a powerful ultra-short wave blast...

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.680
...we'd be able to release everybody under this Zonder spell!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.100
Correct!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.340
Mikoto...

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.840
System Change!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.440
System Change!

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.610
You've got to act as quickly as possible.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.080
I need you to seize the main antenna of the SDC tower...

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:56.950
...and blanket the area with ultra-short wave signals!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.000
Roger that, Chief!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.390
System Change!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.070
Starting transmission!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:06.730
Confirming ultra-short wave transmission...

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:10.110
The SDC employees' destructive activities have ceased.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.400
You did a good job!

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.620
I suppose that will have to do...

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:29.760
Allow me to pass on to you an even more intriguing magic trick.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.880
Go now and show GaoGaiGar a good time!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:37.220
It's a Zonder!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:47.060
Come on! Do you have to pull me so hard, Yosef?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.500
Thanks, Mamoru.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:05.790
I feel a little better now.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.880
Are you sure you can make it, Gai?

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.210
How can I just sit around when there's a Zonder on the loose?

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:12.550
But you shouldn't!

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.090
I can tell what's going to happen!

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.050
If you push yourself any harder, then you're going to...

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:18.930
Don't worry about it...

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.810
I'm coming back no matter what. I promise you!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.730
That's a promise, okay? Remember, you promised!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:28.520
I can't allow you to go into battle when you're not fully recovered!

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:32.110
Chief, I'm asking you to let Gai do whatever he wants.

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:32.940
But...

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:36.490
All the more if it means he doesn't have much time left.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.280
I just want Gai to be free to do as he pleases...

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:44.790
Swan, I want you to take Utsugi's place at the launch console.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.120
Roger!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.920
Double Gun!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:58.140
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:18:03.270 --> 00:18:04.600
A magic trick?

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:16.700
Zonder!

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:19.030
I'm the one you want to fight!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:24.080
Swan! Final Fusion, approved!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.200
Roger!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.290
Final Fusion...

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.710
Program, drive!

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:39.010
Final Fusion!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:25.350
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.770
I'm sending you the Dividing Driver!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.770
Here it comes, take it!

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:32.730
Okay!

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.190
Mirror Coating, start!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:39.780
Launch!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.250
All coordinates, locked down!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.180
Docking has failed!

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:03.140
What?

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:03.640
No!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:21.950
Captain!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.240
GaoGaiGar!

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.820
You really believe...

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:29.370
...that's enough to bring down GaoGaiGar?

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.460
Broken Magnum!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.180
That Zonder Robot is a cluster of micromachines!

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:47.350
It's immune to conventional attacks!

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.970
The concentration of micromachines is...

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:51.220
...so dense that it'll be impossible to thwart with ultra-short waves...

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.730
Big Brother Gai!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:09.200
Professor! Isn't there any way to defeat that Zonder Robo?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:12.790
It may be a cluster of micromachines...

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.290
...but there's still sure to be a core inside it.

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:17.170
If Gai can get a direct hit...

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.420
You mean Hell and Heaven's the only option?

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.130
But if he uses that attack, Gai will...

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:31.220
Zonder!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.480
Why aren't you finishing me off?

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:36.900
Are you just toying with me?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:43.190
Now then, let's see you deliver your death blow, GaoGaiGar!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.780
After all, that's the only thing left in your arsenal!

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.580
I swear I'll bring you down even if it kills me, too!

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:55.160
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.380
Big Brother Gai!

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.170
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:15.850
No! You've got to stop, Big Brother Gai!

00:22:16.060 --> 00:22:17.810
That's not the real core!

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:27.990
What on earth is going on?

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.580
GaoGaiGar, this is how you shall meet your end!

00:22:38.290 --> 00:22:40.540
...Gai?

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.610 --> 00:23:48.740
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:51.150
An earth-bound sun, capable of melting even steel...

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:53.780
The Grand Nova has swallowed up GaoGaiGar.

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:55.530
Does he have a chance?

00:23:55.660 --> 00:24:00.660
GGG has just received a miraculous power to replace Hell and Heaven.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.080
G-Tool... activation approved!

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:05.460
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.500 --> 00:24:07.460
"The Right Arm Must Be Destroyed"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
The Right Arm Must Be Destroyed

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.300
G Tool

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:14.800
This is the Key to Victory!
